WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
Better than ruling the earth.

2
00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:04.010
Better than going to heaven.

3
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:07.050
Better than lordship over all worlds.

4
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.530
An old Buddhist verse says
one thing beats them all:

5
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.080
the first step in holiness.

6
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:15.940
Meanwhile, many lay
Buddhists give to monks,

7
00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.340
keep precepts and make merit,
hoping for a happier rebirth.

8
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:23.990
So how far away is nirvana,
and who gets there?

9
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.360
In this mission, you'll climb
the four stages of awakening,

10
00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:30.240
ending with the arhat, the worthy one.

11
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.850
Then you'll meet the ten fetters
that tie beings to rebirth,

12
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.570
and see which ones each stage breaks.

13
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.030
Your mission: find out
how far away nirvana is,

14
00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.250
and who reaches it.
